      "description": "The measured memory inventory of a linked image, read with the toolchain's own tools: every section with its address and size, the load segments, and how many rows could not be parsed.\n\nEvery name on this page is imported from `helia_profiler`.\n\n**API tier:** `experimental`\n\nGenerated from the `src/helia_profiler` tree `__DOCS_SOURCE_TREE__`.",
